      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: Revenue: ₹2.36t (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹149.8b (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.3% (up from 5.9% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.2% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 9.2% growth forecast for the Insurance industry in India.",
