      "title": "Life Insurance Corporation of India Announces Re-Designates Neelam Kujur as Principal, Zonal Training Centre, Jamshedpur, Effective January 5, 2026",
      "body": "Life Insurance Corporation of India has re-designated Smt. Neelam Kujur, Faculty Member, Zonal Training Centre, Jamshedpur as Principal, Zonal Training Centre, Jamshedpur. Consequent to the above change, Smt. Neelam Kujur, Principal, Zonal Training Centre, Jamshedpur falls under the definition of Senior Management Personnel (\"SMP\") position of the Life Insurance Corporation of India (\"the Corporation\"). Smt. Neelam Kujur joined the Life Insurance Corporation of India in the year 1993. She has graduated from St. Xavier College Ranchi and holds a Post Graduate Diploma in Personnel Management from Xavier Institute of Social Service, Ranchi. In a career spanning more than three decades in the Corporation, she has worked in different capacities at various offices of the Corporation situated in ",
